  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen you get a Group Announcement the Notification Cell in your Quick Menu shows you the Name and Profile Picture of the Person who posted the Announcement Instead of the Group Name and the Group Icon.  \n\nAlso, when you click on the 3 dots of the Announcement in the Notification Tab you get options to Block, Report or view the Profile of the Person who wrote the Announcement.\n\n# Expected Behavior:  \n\nThe Announcement should not be connected with the Person who wrote it. The Notification Cell above the Quick Menu should show information about the Group and you should not be able to Block, etc. the Person who wrote it just from the Announcement Notification.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nThe first picture shows the notification cell and the second picture the User options after clicking on the 2 dots of an Announcement:",
